"Ryada-bess is a young Artonan knight in Emban-art'h's squad."
"She is very short and round-faced, with wild purple hair and a sage-colored knight uniform."
"Her knight skill is Transformer of Life to Water."
"She is open and charming, welcoming others' authority without distress."
"Her friendship tattoo binds her squad to live one day every nine years in honor of the others."
"She takes responsibility for her kills, even of spell-made koobas."
"Bithe says she isn't ready to deepen with anyone, but if she were it would be Emban."
